            "value": "A podcast about names and naming, in a conversational style. Jackson, Caroline, and Stephen interview passersby about their names, then move on to discussing their own names. They move toward a discussion of implications naming in group identity and belonging, presence and sense of place, and animal-human connection and loss.",
